    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hungry Ghosts is a wacky tower defense roguelike game about exorcising hordes of powerful hungry ghosts with various desserts and drinks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a fearless young witch exploring a haunted mansion, fighting off hordes of ghosts with the help of magical dishes ! Your goal is to make your way through a series of levels, fending off increasingly powerful waves of enemies by finding strong dishes, upgrading them in the shop and creating various powerful synergies !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet charming characters with unique abilities and discover new recipes as you explore the mansion\u2019s different zones, defeat ghost bosses, and win the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique runs:</strong> Each level is procedurally generated, with unique mechanics in every area and over a hundred original ghosts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many ways to play:</strong> Discover more than a hundred dishes and a dozen characters, each with a special power that can completely change the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted visuals:</strong> Enjoy a warm, personality-filled art style with colorful characters and ghosts.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hungry Ghosts is a wacky tower defense roguelike game about exorcising hordes of powerful hungry ghosts with various desserts and drinks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a fearless young witch exploring a haunted mansion, fighting off hordes of ghosts with the help of magical dishes ! Your goal is to make your way through a series of levels, fending off increasingly powerful waves of enemies by finding strong dishes, upgrading them in the shop and creating various powerful synergies !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet charming characters with unique abilities and discover new recipes as you explore the mansion\u2019s different zones, defeat ghost bosses, and win the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique runs:</strong> Each level is procedurally generated, with unique mechanics in every area and over a hundred original ghosts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many ways to play:</strong> Discover more than a hundred dishes and a dozen characters, each with a special power that can completely change the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted visuals:</strong> Enjoy a warm, personality-filled art style with colorful characters and ghosts.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Hungry Ghosts is a wild tower defense roguelike where you exorcise hungry ghosts with magical desserts and drinks! Play as a fearless witch and her various companions with unique powers, upgrade your dishes, and unleash powerful synergies to survive haunted waves and defeat terrifying bosses.",
